 </pre>
 The parser will reject =93zo .djan. si .djordj.=94, because in that contex=
t =93djordj.=94 is a name (of selma'o CMENE) rather than a quoted word.
 <p>Note: The current machine parser does not implement =93si=94 erasure.</=
